# UNI reference works — real office drawings

Seven full office drawings that act as the **gold-standard reference set**
for what a finished `bina` (apartment) DWG looks like. Use these as
training corpus for every typology / dimension / layer question.

## Files

Location: `C:\Users\PCZONE.GE\Downloads\` (not in git — copy / hardlink
locally if you need them attached as xrefs).

| File | Likely typology | Size | Use as reference for |
|---|---|---|---|
| `UNI A2.dwg` | A-type variant 2 | ~9.5 MB | small flat, ~45-50 m², 1BR layouts |
| `UNI A3.dwg` | A-type variant 3 | ~8.7 MB | small flat, alternate orientation |
| `UNI A4.dwg` | A-type variant 4 | ~5.8 MB | small flat, end-cap variant |
| `UNI B1.dwg` | B-type variant 1 | ~5.7 MB | standard 2BR ~65 m², mid-row |
